{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53857","headline":"画桐华凤扇赋附歌 · 李德裕","name":"画桐华凤扇赋附歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东风（一作「青春」）晚兮芳节阑，敷紫华兮荫碧湍。\n美斯鸟（一作「兹禽」）兮类鵷鸾，具体微兮容色丹。\n（见《文苑英华》卷一○八、《李文饶别集》卷一。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53857.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53857","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}